//
// SEPARATE FILE ON PURPOSE. sep_unreachable_exclusions.el carries only logic an
// RTL tie makes unreachable. This file carries a scope decision instead: OTBN
// instruction decode and the bignum ALU are lowRISC's DV, not SEP's, so SEP does
// not claim them. Adopting this file lowers the denominator on an ownership
// argument, which is a different kind of claim, and it is kept opt-in so the two
// are never confused in a review.
//
// These modules are NOT entirely dark, so they do not belong in
// sep_cov_scope.hier: modinfo.txt reports otbn_decoder 39.52 % line,
// otbn_predecode 49.24 %, otbn_alu_bignum 58.37 %. A hierarchy exclusion would
// also remove the lines SEP does cover. Arm granularity keeps those graded.
//
// Checksums come from `urg -dump full_exclusions line` on the merged vdb at
// build/runs/20260919_225443__vcs__all/cov/merged.vdb. Never hand-written.
//==================================================

